<title>USA: Moves in Game Four of Kasparov vs. Deep Blue.</title>
<headline>Moves in Game Four of Kasparov vs. Deep Blue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the moves in Wednesday's fourth game of the $1.1 million six-game re-match between world chess champion Garry Kasparov and the IBM supercomputer Deep Blue.</p>
<p>Prybl Defence</p>
<p>Deep Blue (white)  Kasparov (black)</p>
<p>    1.  e4		 c6</p>
<p>    2.  d4		 d6</p>
<p>    3.  Nf3		Nf6</p>
<p>    4.  Nc3		Bg4</p>
<p>    5.  h3		 Bh5</p>
<p>    6.  Bd3		e6</p>
<p>    7.  Qe2		d5</p>
<p>    8.  Bg5		Be7</p>
